Roomwise Gemma 4 E4B LoRA experiments

Base model: google/gemma-4-E4B-it, published by Google.
Base model license: Apache License, Version 2.0.
Official license reference: https://ai.google.dev/gemma/apache_2
Base model card: https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-4-E4B-it

Roomwise contributors trained the included LoRA tensor deltas on authored
synthetic housing-evidence examples. They also changed the published PEFT
configuration's local base path to the public model identity and recorded
the historical resolved revision, where available. Tensor bytes are unchanged.
See each manifest for hashes and the v3 revision-verification limitation.

No base weights or tokenizer copies are distributed in this repository.
These are experimental modifications, not an official Google release or endorsement.
